WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.663 --> 00:00:09.829
Bird was reading a book in her nest.

2
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.977
Kip came up the tree.

3
00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:14.775
He was carrying a bunch of sticks.

4
00:00:14.776 --> 00:00:19.533
"Good morning, Bird," said Kip.

5
00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:23.446
"Good morning, Kip," said Bird.

6
00:00:23.447 --> 00:00:25.631
Kip went back down the tree.

7
00:00:25.632 --> 00:00:28.024
Then he came up the tree again.

8
00:00:28.025 --> 00:00:33.169
He was carrying more sticks.

9
00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:38.057
"Hmm," said Bird.

10
00:00:38.058 --> 00:00:42.684
"I wonder what Kip is doing."

11
00:00:42.685 --> 00:00:46.308
Bird went back to reading her book.

12
00:00:46.309 --> 00:00:48.158
Crash !

13
00:00:48.159 --> 00:00:50.613
"Ouch!" cried Bird.

14
00:00:50.614 --> 00:00:55.082
"Please be careful, Kip."

15
00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:57.880
"Sorry about that!" said Kip.

16
00:00:57.881 --> 00:01:01.447
Bird flew up to Kip's branch.

17
00:01:01.448 --> 00:01:06.623
"What are you doing?" asked Bird.

18
00:01:06.624 --> 00:01:12.688
"I'm collecting sticks," said Kip.

19
00:01:12.689 --> 00:01:16.509
"Why do you need sticks?" asked Bird.

20
00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:20.992
"I'm building something," said Kip.

21
00:01:20.993 --> 00:01:24.894
"I need a lot of sticks for it."

22
00:01:24.895 --> 00:01:28.720
"What are you building?" asked Bird.

23
00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:31.015
"A nest," said Kip.

24
00:01:31.016 --> 00:01:36.406
"I'm building a nest for myself!"

